    {
      "id": "claim_6c37d58a09b842fe8c3cea2e7a53ec48",
      "statement": "Each family's controller instantiates and configures its own runner class before the service's dedup check: ArDoCodeController uses Ardocode with CodeConfiguration (ACM_FILE), ArCoTLController uses Arcotl with ArchitectureConfiguration and CodeConfiguration, SwattrController uses Swattr with ArchitectureConfiguration, TransArCController uses Transarc with ArchitectureConfiguration and CodeConfiguration, and InconsistencyController uses edu.kit.kastel.mcse.ardoco.id.execution.runner.InconsistencyDetection with raw text and model files plus the model format. Each runner's output directory is a throwaway temp directory named ardoco-sad-code, ardoco-sam-code, ardoco-sad-sam, ardoco-sad-sam-code, or ardoco-id respectively.",
      "evidence": [
