    {
      "id": "claim_ea74134c6df2453fbaa26cd38dc23e0c",
      "statement": "Required multipart inputs differ per family: ArDoCode requires projectName, inputText, and inputCode; ArCoTL requires projectName, inputArchitectureModel, inputArchitectureModelFormat (a ModelFormat enum bound via ModelFormatTypeConverter), and inputCode; SWATTR and the inconsistency workflow require projectName, inputText, inputArchitectureModel, and inputArchitectureModelFormat; TransArC requires all four plus inputCode. All families optionally accept additionalConfigs JSON, parsed by AbstractController.parseAdditionalConfigs (invalid JSON raises FileConversionException). The REST layer only validates that uploaded files are non-empty; deeper format checks are left to ArDoCo.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/tlr/rest/api/controller/AbstractController.java#L43-L48",
