      "id": "claim_c18e987eced5404eb9e8feace7a83898",
      "statement": "Only InconsistencyService returns a populated inconsistencies array: it converts both the sad-sam trace links and result.getAllInconsistencies() via InconsistencyConverter and uses the two-argument ArDoCoApiResult constructor. The four recovery services (ArDoCodeService, ArCoTLService, SwattrService, TransArCService) use the single-argument constructor, which sets inconsistencies to the literal \"[]\". Inconsistency entries carry type and reason, plus sentenceNumber for TextEntityAbsentFromModel and modelElementId for ModelEntityAbsentFromText.",
