    {
      "id": "claim_ebbb41593f1e49178ef201141624224b",
      "statement": "Extending the API with a new family requires a new TraceLinkType entry, a controller extending AbstractController with /start and /start-and-wait handlers, an AbstractRunnerTLRService subclass implementing convertResultToJsonString, and a controller test subclassing AbstractTLRControllerTest (which derives endpoint paths from the TraceLinkType endpoint name); the shared dedup, async execution, Redis storage, ID generation, and cross-family retrieval machinery needs no changes.",
